repository-code: "https://github.com/sufyansuleman/cdisc-with-r"
url: "https://sufyansuleman.github.io/cdisc-with-r/"
abstract: >-
  A free, self-paced, hands-on course on CDISC clinical data standards in R.
  Learners take the raw export from a simulated Phase III trial (GLPX-1) and
  carry it to submission-shaped output: SDTM domains, ADaM datasets,
  Define-XML, tables, listings and figures, the Analysis Data Reviewer's
  Guide, and Dataset-JSON. All data is synthetic; no real patient information
  appears anywhere. Every figure and number in the course is produced by
  executed code rather than asserted.
